{"id":"fortuna","lemma":"fortuna","pos":"noun","rank":384,"glosses":["luck","fortune"],"ipa":"/forˈtu.na/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"fortune"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/18/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-Crunchy_Cloaky_Crackdown-fortuna.wav","examples":[{"text":"OK, mi auguri fortuna.","en":"OK, wish me luck.","words":[null,{"g":"me / myself"},{"g":"wish","l":"augurio"},null]},{"text":"Alcune persone hanno tutta la fortuna.","en":"Some people have all the luck.","words":[{"g":"some, a few","l":"alcuno"},{"g":"person","l":"persona"},{"g":"to have","l":"avere"},{"g":"everything, all","l":"tutto"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Buona fortuna con quello.","en":"Good luck with that.","words":[{"g":"righteous, moral","l":"buono"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"that"}]},{"text":"Addio e buona fortuna.","en":"Goodbye and good luck.","words":[{"g":"goodbye, farewell"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"righteous, moral","l":"buono"},null]},{"text":"Ho avuto fortuna.","en":"I got lucky.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/993460","words":[{"g":"have","l":"avere"},{"g":"to have","l":"avere"},null]}]}